@startuml
header draft
title Everything\n<i>at once</i>
footer page 1
caption Figure 1: all constructs
autonumber
actor User
box "Front end" #LightBlue
participant "Web App" as Web <<spa>>
boundary Gate
end box
control Ctrl
entity Ent
database DB
collections Coll
queue Q

[-> User : wake up
User -> Web ++ : open
Web -> Web : render **bold** and //italic//
note right : beside the\nself message
Web -> Gate ++ #gold : call
Gate -> Ctrl : forward
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> Ctrl ++ : nested
Ctrl --> Gate -- : done
deactivate Ctrl
return ok
== Phase 2 ==
Web ->> Ent : async
Web -\ DB : half
Web ->x Coll : lost
Web ->o Q : circle
Web o->o Q : circles
Q x-> Web : cross first
Web <-> Q : both
Web -[#red]> DB : red
Web -[bold]> DB : bold
note left of User : left note
note over Gate, Ctrl #aqua
  spanning
  note
end note
hnote over DB : hex
rnote across : across everyone
|||
ref over Web, DB : refresh token
create participant Late
Web -> Late : new
Late -> Late : self
destroy Late
...
... 5 minutes later ...
loop 3 times
  Web -> DB : retry
  opt cached
    DB --> Web : hit
  end
end
group audit [log]
  Web ->] : out
  ?-> Web : short in
end
Web ->? : short out
@enduml
